---
source: apps/oxcruise/tests/cli.rs
expression: table.stdout
---
correctness (default: error)
  no-circular                Reports dependencies that are part of a circular chain of imports.
  no-cross-package-relative  Reports relative imports that reach into another workspace package, for example `../other-package/src/x`.
  no-dev-deps-in-prod        Reports a production module that imports a package from `devDependencies` only.
  no-test-imports            Reports a non-test module that imports a test file or a test directory.
  no-undeclared-deps         Reports imports of installed npm packages that no `package.json` section declares.
  no-unresolvable            Reports an import that oxcruise cannot resolve to a file or a package.

suspicious (default: warn)
  no-deprecated              Reports imports of deprecated Node.js built-in modules and deprecated npm packages.
  no-duplicate-deps          Reports a package that more than one `package.json` section declares, for example both `dependencies` and `devDependencies`.
  no-orphans                 Reports modules that no other module imports and that import no module.

style (default: off)

restriction (default: off)
  internal-modules           Restricts access to `internal` directories, as the Go language does.
  layers                     Enforces a layered architecture: a layer can import only the layers that `allow` lists for it.
  no-optional-deps           Reports use of optional dependencies.
  no-peer-deps               Reports use of peer dependencies.

nursery (default: off)
  no-unused-deps             Reports a package that a `package.json` declares and that none of its modules imports.
  no-unused-exports          Reports exports that no other module imports.
  no-unused-files            Reports source modules that no path from an entry point reaches.

16 rules
